	other_contributors = <"Sol Fustinana, University Hospital Basel, Switzerland","Olha Nikolaieva, University Hospital Basel, Switzerland","Maren Diepenbruck, University Hospital Basel, Switzerland">
	details = <
		["de"] = <
			language = <[ISO_639-1::de]>
			purpose = <"Zur Erfassung der Antworten auf die fünf Items des Sexual Health Inventory for Men (SHIM), auch als International Index of Erectile Function-5 (IIEF-5) bezeichnet, sowie des zugehörigen Gesamtscores.">
			keywords = <"IIEF-5, SHIM, Internationaler Index der erektilen Funktion, Erektile Dysfunktion, Sexuelle Funktion, Patientenberichtetes Ergebnis, Urologie", ...>
			copyright = <"© openEHR Foundation">
			use = <"Zur Erfassung und zum Austausch der Antworten und Ergebnisse des Sexual Health Inventory for Men (SHIM/IIEF-5) in digitalen Systemen verwenden.

Obwohl openEHR-Archetypen unter einer offenen Lizenz frei verfügbar sind, sind die spezifischen Inhalte des SHIM/IIEF-5 in diesem Archetyp urheberrechtlich geschützt. Jede Nutzung dieses Archetyps in Implementierungen muss den vom Rechteinhaber festgelegten Bedingungen entsprechen.

Copyright holder: IQVIA Inc. (2000).
Licensing information: https://coas.iqvia.com/COAs/sexual-health-inventory-for-men

Für die Nutzung des SHIM/IIEF-5 ist eine Lizenz bei IQVIA anzufordern.">
			misuse = <"Nicht zur Dokumentation einer Diagnose einer erektilen Dysfunktion verwenden; hierfür den Archetyp EVALUATION.problem_diagnosis verwenden.">
		>
		["en"] = <
			language = <[ISO_639-1::en]>
			purpose = <"To record responses to the five items of the Sexual Health Inventory for Men (SHIM), also known as the International Index of Erectile Function-5 (IIEF-5), together with the corresponding total score.">
			keywords = <"IIEF-5, SHIM, International Index of Erectile Function, Erectile dysfunction, Sexual function, Patient reported outcome, Urology", ...>
			copyright = <"© openEHR Foundation">
			use = <"Use to record and exchange responses and results for the Sexual Health Inventory for Men (SHIM/IIEF-5) in digital systems.

While openEHR archetypes are freely available under an open licence, the specific SHIM/IIEF-5 content in this archetype is copyright protected. Any use of this archetype within implementations must comply with the terms established by the copyright holder.

Copyright holder: IQVIA Inc. (2000).
Licensing information: https://coas.iqvia.com/COAs/sexual-health-inventory-for-men

A licence must be requested from IQVIA for use of the SHIM/IIEF-5.">
			misuse = <"Not to be used to record a diagnosis of erectile dysfunction; use the EVALUATION.problem_diagnosis archetype for this purpose.">
		>
		["it"] = <
			language = <[ISO_639-1::it]>
			purpose = <"Registrare le risposte ai cinque item del Sexual Health Inventory for Men (SHIM), noto anche come International Index of Erectile Function-5 (IIEF-5), insieme al corrispondente punteggio totale.">
			keywords = <"IIEF-5, SHIM, Indice Internazionale della Funzione Erettile, Disfunzione erettile, Funzione sessuale, Esito riferito dal paziente, Urologia", ...>
			copyright = <"© openEHR Foundation">
			use = <"Utilizzare per registrare e scambiare in sistemi digitali le risposte e i risultati del Sexual Health Inventory for Men (SHIM/IIEF-5).

Sebbene gli archetipi openEHR siano liberamente disponibili con una licenza aperta, il contenuto specifico SHIM/IIEF-5 di questo archetipo è protetto dal diritto d'autore. Qualsiasi utilizzo di questo archetipo nelle implementazioni deve rispettare le condizioni stabilite dal titolare dei diritti.

Copyright holder: IQVIA Inc. (2000).
Licensing information: https://coas.iqvia.com/COAs/sexual-health-inventory-for-men

Per utilizzare lo SHIM/IIEF-5 è necessario richiedere una licenza a IQVIA.">
			misuse = <"Non utilizzare per registrare una diagnosi di disfunzione erettile; a questo scopo utilizzare l'archetipo EVALUATION.problem_diagnosis.">
		>
		["fr"] = <
			language = <[ISO_639-1::fr]>
			purpose = <"Enregistrer les réponses aux cinq items du Sexual Health Inventory for Men (SHIM), également appelé International Index of Erectile Function-5 (IIEF-5), ainsi que le score total correspondant.">
			keywords = <"IIEF-5, SHIM, Indice international de la fonction érectile, Dysfonction érectile, Fonction sexuelle, Résultat rapporté par le patient, Urologie", ...>
			copyright = <"© openEHR Foundation">
			use = <"Utiliser pour enregistrer et échanger dans des systèmes numériques les réponses et les résultats du Sexual Health Inventory for Men (SHIM/IIEF-5).

Bien que les archétypes openEHR soient librement disponibles sous une licence ouverte, le contenu spécifique du SHIM/IIEF-5 dans cet archétype est protégé par le droit d'auteur. Toute utilisation de cet archétype dans une implémentation doit respecter les conditions établies par le titulaire des droits.

Copyright holder: IQVIA Inc. (2000).
Licensing information: https://coas.iqvia.com/COAs/sexual-health-inventory-for-men

Une licence doit être demandée à IQVIA pour utiliser le SHIM/IIEF-5.">
			misuse = <"Ne pas utiliser pour enregistrer un diagnostic de dysfonction érectile ; utiliser l'archétype EVALUATION.problem_diagnosis à cette fin.">
		>
	>
	other_details = <
		["licence"] = <"This work is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International License. To view a copy of this license, visit http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/.">
		["custodian_organisation"] = <"openEHR Foundation">
		["references"] = <"Rosen RC, Cappelleri JC, Smith MD, Lipsky J, Peña BM. Development and evaluation of an abridged, 5-item version of the International Index of Erectile Function (IIEF-5) as a diagnostic tool for erectile dysfunction. International Journal of Impotence Research. 1999;11(6):319-326.

IQVIA. Sexual Health Inventory for Men (SHIM). Clinical Outcome Assessments. Copyright holder and licensing information. https://coas.iqvia.com/COAs/sexual-health-inventory-for-men">
		["current_contact"] = <"">
		["original_namespace"] = <"org.openehr">
		["original_publisher"] = <"openEHR Foundation">
		["custodian_namespace"] = <"org.openehr">
		["MD5-CAM-1.0.1"] = <"a62872051831537912002f22aff3c3d8">
		["build_uid"] = <"9cc46d45-b954-4441-93a2-648b4df628b1">
		["ip_acknowledgements"] = <"The Sexual Health Inventory for Men (SHIM), also known as IIEF-5, was developed by Raymond C. Rosen, Allen R. Cappelleri, Ronald C. Smith, James Lipsky, and Benjamin M. Peña. IQVIA currently identifies IQVIA Inc. (2000) as the copyright holder and manages licensing for use of the instrument.">
	>

definition
	OBSERVATION[at0000] matches {    -- iief5_shittymeta
		data matches {
			HISTORY[at0001] matches {    -- History
				events cardinality matches {1..*; unordered} matches {
					EVENT[at0002] occurrences matches {0..*} matches {    -- Any event
						data matches {
							ITEM_TREE[at0003] matches {    -- Tree
								items cardinality matches {0..*; unordered} matches {
									CLUSTER[at9000] occurrences matches {0..1} matches {    -- Over the past 6 months
										items cardinality matches {1..*; unordered} matches {
											ELEMENT[at0004] occurrences matches {0..1} matches {    -- How do you rate your confidence that you could get and keep an erection?
												value matches {
													1|[local::at0005],
													2|[local::at0006],
													3|[local::at0007],
													4|[local::at0008],
													5|[local::at0009]
												}
											}
											ELEMENT[at0010] occurrences matches {0..1} matches {    -- When you had erections with sexual stimulation, how often were your erections hard enough for penetration?
												value matches {
													1|[local::at0012],
													2|[local::at0013],
													3|[local::at0014],
													4|[local::at0015],
													5|[local::at0016]
												}
											}
											ELEMENT[at0017] occurrences matches {0..1} matches {    -- During sexual intercourse, how often were you able to maintain your erection after you had penetrated (entered) your partner?
												value matches {
													1|[local::at0019],
													2|[local::at0020],
													3|[local::at0021],
													4|[local::at0022],
													5|[local::at0023]
												}
											}
											ELEMENT[at0024] occurrences matches {0..1} matches {    -- During sexual intercourse, how difficult was it to maintain your erection to completion of intercourse?
												value matches {
													1|[local::at0026],
													2|[local::at0027],
													3|[local::at0028],
													4|[local::at0029],
													5|[local::at0030]
												}
											}
											ELEMENT[at0031] occurrences matches {0..1} matches {    -- When you attempted sexual intercourse, how often was it satisfactory for you?
												value matches {
													1|[local::at0033],
													2|[local::at0034],
													3|[local::at0035],
													4|[local::at0036],
													5|[local::at0037]
												}
											}
										}
									}
									ELEMENT[at0038] occurrences matches {0..1} matches {    -- Total score
										value matches {
											DV_COUNT matches {*}
										}
									}
								}
							}
						}
					}
				}
			}
		}
	}

ontology
	term_definitions = <
		["de"] = <
			items = <
				["at0000"] = <
					text = <"iief5_shittymeta">
					description = <"Der International Index of Erectile Function-5 (IIEF-5), auch Sexual Health Inventory for Men (SHIM) genannt, ist ein validierter patientenberichteter Fragebogen zur Beurteilung der erektilen Funktion und zum Screening auf erektile Dysfunktion.">
				>
				["at0004"] = <
					text = <"Wie hoch schätzen Sie Ihre Zuversichtlichkeit ein, bei sexueller Erregung eine Erektion zu bekommen und aufrecht erhalten zu können?">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0005"] = <
					text = <"sehr niedrig">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0006"] = <
					text = <"niedrig">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0007"] = <
					text = <"moderat">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0008"] = <
					text = <"hoch">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0009"] = <
					text = <"sehr hoch">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0010"] = <
					text = <"Wie häufig war Ihre Erektion nach sexueller Stimulation hart genug für eine Penetration?">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0012"] = <
					text = <"fast nie/ nie">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0013"] = <
					text = <"selten(seltener als in der Hälfte der Fälle)">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0014"] = <
					text = <"manchmal(etwa in der Hälfte der Fälle)">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0015"] = <
					text = <"meistens(häufiger als in der Hälfte der Fälle)">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0016"] = <
					text = <"fast immer/ immer">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0017"] = <
					text = <"Wie häufig konnten Sie Ihre Erektion beim Geschlechtsverkehr aufrecht erhalten, nachdem Sie in Ihre Partnerin eingedrungen waren?">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0019"] = <
					text = <"fast nie/ nie">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0020"] = <
					text = <"selten(seltener als in der Hälfte der Fälle)">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0021"] = <
					text = <"manchmal(etwa in der Hälfte der Fälle)">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0022"] = <
					text = <"meistens(häufiger als in der Hälfte der Fälle)">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0023"] = <
					text = <"fast immer/ immer">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0024"] = <
					text = <"Wie schwierig ist es für Sie, Ihre Erektion bis zum Ende des Geschlechtsverkehrs aufrecht zu erhalten?">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0026"] = <
					text = <"extrem schwierig">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0027"] = <
					text = <"sehr schwierig">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0028"] = <
					text = <"schwierig">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0029"] = <
					text = <"wenig schwierig">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0030"] = <
					text = <"überhaupt nicht schwierig">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0031"] = <
					text = <"Wie oft würden Sie den Geschlechtsverkehr mit Ihrer Partnerin als befriedigend einstufen?">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0033"] = <
					text = <"fast nie/ nie">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0034"] = <
					text = <"selten(seltener als in der Hälfte der Fälle)">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0035"] = <
					text = <"manchmal(etwa in der Hälfte der Fälle)">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0036"] = <
					text = <"meistens(häufiger als in der Hälfte der Fälle)">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0037"] = <
					text = <"fast immer/ immer">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at0038"] = <
					text = <"Total score">
					description = <"">
				>
				["at9000"] = <
					text = <"Während der vergangenen 6 Monate:">
					description = <"Während der vergangenen 6 Monate:">
